am-building \n* Networking \n* Employee Rewards\n\n___________________________________\n## Rates\n\n$125 - $495 per person + tax and gratuity, depending on the itinerary.\n\n**We do require a minimum of $1000 + tax and gratuity for all private events.*\n\n*(Ages 18+)*\n___________________________________\n\n\n##Please select your desired tour date from the calendar and complete the form to submit your inquiry.\n\n*Please note: this is a Private Corporate Tour Inquiry only, not a booking. Private tours are booked on a first come basis, and dates are *not* confirmed without a booking deposit.  \n\n***Thank you - We will be in touch shortly!***\n\n---", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Boston, MA", "booking_notes": "#Thank You for your inquiry and interest in our tours for your group outing - we will be in touch soon!", "cancellation_notes": "***THIS SUBMISSION REPRESENTS A REQUEST FOR INFORMATION ONLY.** \nNo purchases have yet been made, and your event has not yet booked or confirmed. We will be in touch with additional information shortly.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Make Your Next Outing Memorable...and Delicious!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bitesofbostonfoodtours/items/191688/images/1178203/", "pk": 1178203, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4NM11cBHSE2LIGA21v42", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4NM11cBHSE2LIGA21v42", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bitesofbostonfoodtours/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bitesofbostonfoodtours/items/191688/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4NM11cBHSE2LIGA21v42", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/4NM11cBHSE2LIGA21v42", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": fals